Demonstration of Proposed Features
1. User Creation

Demonstrate the creation of the authorized test user.

2. Role Creation

Demonstrate the roles assigned for access control.

3. Table Creation

Demonstrate the u_institution_details table.

4. Record Creation

Demonstrate the creation of institution records with different Branch values.

5. READ Access

Demonstrate the configured READ restriction.

6. CREATE Access

Demonstrate the CREATE permission.

7. WRITE Access

Demonstrate the WRITE permission.

8. DELETE Access

Demonstrate the DELETE permission.

9. Administrator Access

Demonstrate that administrators retain complete access.

10. Final Output

Demonstrate that authorized users can perform permitted operations while unauthorized operations are restricted.
